config BR2_PACKAGE_BRICK_POWER
	bool "Brick power controls"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_DBUS
	help
	  Six-second power-key hold and validated critical battery state
	  request orderly shutdown. Stock idle dim/backlight-off policy and
	  short power-key backlight control. Optional automatic s2idle is disabled
	  by default pending device qualification. Explicit and automatic s2idle
	  preserve audio, Bluetooth power and standard mood LED brightness.
